==== Secondary Outcomes

    - Difference in TSPO-PET binding between ME/CFS patients and activity-matched healthy comparators
    - Regional specificity: which brain regions show signal changes most relevant to PEM
    - Difference between progressive and stable PEM groups at baseline and 12 months
    - Association between immunomodulatory treatment initiation (including LDN) and TSPO change; confounded by indication, not an efficacy estimate
    - Correlation of TSPO-PET with plasma hs-CRP, IL-6, sIL-6R, and CHI3L1/YKL-40
    - Correlation of TSPO-PET with cognitive and functional measures
